@startuml seq-3-hitl-reject
title Sequence 3 · Human-in-the-loop: отказ и защита от прямого вызова
autonumber
actor Дежурный as U
participant "Graph\n(checkpointer)" as G
participant "Human gate" as H
participant "ops-tools" as M
participant Scribe as SC
G -> H : remediation approved by validator
